T*
T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf (- DeepEval: one GEval metric, Property Recommendation Quality, threshold 0.6. It) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  assesses whether the recommendation uses the input, grounds the estimate in historical) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  comparables, identifies uncertainty, and avoids unsupported or causal claims. The API) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  reports score, threshold verdict, and reason; if Claude or DeepEval fails, it reports) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  evaluation unavailable without breaking valuation.) Tj
T*
