T*
/F1 10 Tf (- LLM-as-Judge: a separate Claude explanation judge returns groundedness, relevance,) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  completeness, evidence usage, reasoning quality, verdict, and unsupported claims. If) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  not configured or unavailable, deterministic checks are labelled as such; they are not) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  LLM scores.) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (- Regression metrics: training compares candidate regressors by holdout MAE; the) Tj
