/F1 10 Tf (  training artifact also records MAE, RMSE, and R-squared \(R?\). These measure prediction) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  error/fit on the configured split, not live-market accuracy.) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (- Retrieval evaluation: scripts/evaluateretrieval.py reports latency and number of) Tj
