T*
/F1 10 Tf (  it does not claim retrieval precision, recall, MAP, or nDCG.) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (- Automated tests: tests/testcore.py covers extraction, prompt-like query rejection,) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  name-only rejection, and missing-information handling. tests/testretrieval.py covers) Tj
