T*
/F1 10 Tf (12. Challenges and trade-offs) Tj
T*
T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf (- The Ames data is historical and geographically narrow; the model is not suitable for) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  current market valuation or other regions without representative data and retraining.) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (- Structured row-level documents make retrieval auditable and avoid arbitrary text) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  chunks, but they do not support full-text property reports. Long documents would need) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  a chunking policy and deduplication.) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (- MiniLM and local Chroma reduce embedding-service cost and keep vectors local, with) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  trade-offs in download time, local memory, and model quality compared with larger) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  hosted encoders.) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (- Semantic retrieval handles paraphrases while BM25 is strong for exact tokens; RRF) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  avoids calibrating incomparable raw scores but may not be optimal without labelled) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  relevance judgments.) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (- Strict metadata filters improve comparability but can return too few records.) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  Progressive relaxation improves coverage and is surfaced as a safeguard, at the cost) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  of less exact matches.) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (- A tree-regression model is efficient for tabular features and explainable through) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  SHAP, but its estimates reflect historical correlations and dataset bias. Feature) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  impacts are descriptive model explanations, not causal effects.) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (- External Claude/DeepEval calls add latency, network dependence, and provider cost.) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  Evaluations are optional and isolated from the price estimate; failures must remain) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  visible rather than being represented as successful LLM judgments.) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (- Incomplete descriptions require median imputation. The UI surfaces incompleteness and) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  uncertainty because imputation cannot recover facts that were never supplied.) Tj
T*
T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf (13. Reliability and safeguards) Tj
T*
T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf (- Input validation returns HTTP 422 for invalid values or unsupported property changes.) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (- Chroma/embedding/model availability is reported by health endpoints and deterministic) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  retrieval or valuation fallbacks are used where implemented.) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (- Optional LLM and DeepEval failures are reported as unavailable or deterministic) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  evaluation status; valuation remains available.) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (- Missing values are imputed with training medians where required.) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (- Comparables and uncertainty are historical evidence. Explanations avoid unsupported) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  causal interpretation.) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (- The LLM receives calculated valuation context for explanation review and cannot author) Tj
T*
/F1 10 Tf (  numeric prediction fields.) Tj
T*
T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf (14. Local operation) Tj
T*
T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf (Install backend dependencies, prepare/train data if artifacts need rebuilding, run the) Tj
T*
ET
